# Generated from: specs/33-name-clinepass-models-by-their-model-not-their-id/requirements.md
Feature: ClinePass models are named by their model, not their id

  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: A paid model named by its id is named by its model
    Given ClinePass lists "cline-pass/qwen3.7-max" named "cline-pass/qwen3.7-max"
    When the catalog refreshes
    Then the model is named "qwen3.7-max"

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: A free model named by its id is named by its bare model
    Given ClinePass's free list has "cline-free/solar-mini4" named "cline-free/solar-mini4"
    When the catalog refreshes
    Then the model is named "solar-mini4 (free)"

  @SCN003 @regression
  Scenario: A real name is kept
    Given ClinePass's free list has "cline-pass/deepseek-v4-flash" named "DeepSeek V4 Flash"
    When the catalog refreshes
    Then the model is named "DeepSeek V4 Flash (free)"
